==============================================================================
Q7 -- offset demonstration & noise-free Bayes accuracy from offset alone
n_per_class=20000, jitter_std=0.03, heart_rate_hz=1.15, seed=42
==============================================================================

Total windows collected: 239734  (target 60000; shortfall from occasional truncated last-beat windows near t=3s, same as extract_raw_windows).

tof per class (deterministic, from time_of_flight_s): healthy=8.4063ms, significant_fibrosis=6.5115ms, cirrhosis=5.1478ms
sample spacing dt (time[1]-time[0]) = 2.001334ms  (np.linspace(0,3,1500) grid, not exactly 1/500Hz=2.000ms)

--- k=0 check: offset should equal tof exactly ---
  healthy                n= 20000  offset==tof to within max|err|=0.000e+00s (float64 rounding only) -> MATCH
  significant_fibrosis   n= 20000  offset==tof to within max|err|=0.000e+00s (float64 rounding only) -> MATCH
  cirrhosis              n= 20000  offset==tof to within max|err|=0.000e+00s (float64 rounding only) -> MATCH

--- k>=1 check: offset should be tof - U[0, dt) ---
  healthy                n= 59904  frac=tof-offset: min=0.00011ms max=2.00130ms mean=1.00066ms  (expected range [0,2.00133)ms, expected mean~1.00067ms)  -> MATCH
  significant_fibrosis   n= 59919  frac=tof-offset: min=0.00010ms max=2.00120ms mean=1.00189ms  (expected range [0,2.00133)ms, expected mean~1.00067ms)  -> MATCH
  cirrhosis              n= 59911  frac=tof-offset: min=0.00006ms max=2.00130ms mean=0.99690ms  (expected range [0,2.00133)ms, expected mean~1.00067ms)  -> MATCH

==============================================================================
Noise-free Bayes accuracy from offset alone -- EXACT analytic decision rule
(uses the generator's known exact distribution: point mass at tof for k=0, uniform on (tof-dt,tof] for k>=1 -- no density estimation/smoothing)
==============================================================================

Overall exact Bayes accuracy (offset alone): 90.5994%  (n_test=71921)

